# Playwright proof-harness output (Phase 1 item 9).
#
# These are screenshots, video frames and results.json written by the harnesses
# in tools/proof/. They reached 186 MB across thirteen directories and were
# being sent to Fly as build context on every single deploy. They are outputs:
# re-runnable, and never worth committing. The results.json files that mattered
# were kept in docs/history/proof-results/.
/gauntlet-*/
/billing-*/
/proof-*/
